<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Eagle raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Eagle raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter upgraded American Eagle Outfitters Inc to buy from neutral, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-7/8 to 22-7/8.</p>
<p>-- The company this morning reported third-quarter profits of $0.21 a share, compared with a year-ago loss of $0.14 a share. The prior quarter included a loss of $0.19 a share from the sale of assets.</p>
</text>
